    "extractedVia": "Figma MCP get_variable_defs on the Colors, Text, Headings, Buttons and Controls frames, plus rendered screenshots of Buttons / Controls / App frame for shape values",
    "note": "The kit publishes real Figma variables for colour and type; every value under `palette` and `typography` is verbatim from them. `semantic`, `radius`, `borderWidth`, `shadow` and `spacing` are read off the rendered components and the kit's own Spacing/Tokens boards — see README.md for which is which. The kit ships LIGHT ONLY; the second entry of every `semantic` pair is a synthesised dark mode (see README)."
  },

